# Per-package lockfiles. The root lockfile is the tracked one: the agent is a
# workspace member so it is covered there, and the mobile package's own lock
# still resolves @indianic/* through a registry that this project no longer
# uses. Regenerate and track that one only once @dialout/shared is published.
